  "period_note": "Year-end (31 December 2024) position from Islami Bank Bangladesh's own audited annual report 'Five Years Performance' table, taken from the FY2024 report (the reporting year's own document). SOLO / STANDALONE basis. Islami Bank Bangladesh is a Shariah-compliant bank, so its own terminology is used in original_metric_name: 'Investment' is the financing book (the equivalent of loans and advances), 'Investment Income' is the equivalent of interest income, and 'Profit Paid on deposit' is the equivalent of interest expense. The normalised metric names map these onto the dataset's conventional banking vocabulary: gross_loans holds General Investment, net_interest_income holds Net Investment Income, and classified_loans holds Classified Investment. Total liabilities are calculated as total assets (excluding contra) minus shareholders' equity; the source table does not print a total-liabilities line. total_assets is the balance-sheet total EXCLUDING contra items, which is the comparable figure for other banks in this dataset; the bank's own 'Total Assets (including Contra)' is retained separately as total_assets_incl_contra and is materially larger. The FY2024 report's own capital rows do not reconcile and one has lost a digit in text extraction: it prints Tier-I 62,519.04 plus Tier-II 32,998.64 = 95,517.68 against a stated Regulatory Capital of 100,672.14, and risk-weighted assets as 132,922.20. This record therefore uses the FY2025 report's FY2024 figures for those three lines: Tier-I 73,463.75 and Tier-II 27,208.40 sum to 100,672.15, exactly the regulatory capital both reports agree on, and RWA of 1,329,222.20 reproduces the 7.57% capital adequacy ratio the FY2024 report itself states (100,672.14 / 0.0757 = 1,329,883). This is the one place in this bank's series where a later report is preferred over the contemporaneous one, and it is done because the contemporaneous figures are arithmetically impossible, not merely different. RESTATEMENTS -- 5 figure(s) in this record are reported differently by other Islami Bank annual reports. Per this dataset's sourcing rule the contemporaneous value is kept and the divergence recorded here: risk_weighted_assets: this record uses 132922 (AR2024); AR2025 report 1.32922e+06; tier1_capital: this record uses 62519 (AR2024); AR2025 report 73463.8; tier2_capital: this record uses 32998.6 (AR2024); AR2025 report 27208.4; provision_classified: this record uses 48844.1 (AR2024); AR2025 report 60022.4; provision_required_classified: this record uses 48844.1 (AR2024); AR2025 report 71830.8.",
